<title>UK: Ontario sets $60 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ontario sets $60 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVINCE OF ONTARIO</p>
<p> AMT    $60 MLN	 COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    18.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35.67 BP  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> LISTING    UNLISTED  DENOMS (K) FIVE	GOV LAW    ONTARIO</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>		LAUNCHED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
